{'symbol': 'VTR', 'date': '2023-03-03 16:23:00', 'title': 'VENTAS TO PARTICIPATE IN INVESTOR MEETINGS AT CITI 2023 GLOBAL PROPERTY CEO CONFERENCE', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VENTAS, INC. (NYSE: VTR) (“VENTAS” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT MANAGEMENT WILL MAKE A PRESENTATION AT THE CITI 2023 GLOBAL PROPERTY CEO CONFERENCE (THE “CITI CONFERENCE”) ON MARCH 7, 2023 AT 3:00 P.M. EASTERN TIME. THE WEBCAST WILL BE ACCESSIBLE ON THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE AT IR.VENTASREIT.COM/EVENTS-AND-PRESENTATIONS."}